# frontend-react — token-efficient

Stay in `frontend-react/**`. Smallest correct diff. Monorepo + API map: `.cursor/rules/project.mdc`.

## Skip
`node_modules/`, `dist/`, `.vite/`, `.env*`, `dist/assets/*`, lock/media unless versions matter

## Stack
React 19 · Vite 8 · TS 6 · Tailwind 4 · react-router 7. Hooks/context only (no Redux).

## Task → path
- Routes/nav → `src/App.tsx`, `components/layout/Header.tsx`
- Page → `src/pages/{home,dashboard,tokens,transactions,analysis,wallet,strategies,settings,not-found}/` (thin: fetch/stream + compose)
- Columns → `*Columns.tsx` + `components/table/DataTable`
- REST → `services/api.ts` only; types → `types/index.ts` (snake_case)
- SSE → `services/sse.ts`, `hooks/useTradeStream.ts` (`trade_executed`)
- SOL/USD → `usePriceDisplay`, `PriceUnitContext`, `utils/format.ts`
- Feature UI → `components/{layout,table,ui,tokens,tpsl,transactions,wallet,analysis}/`

Routes: `/` `/dashboard` `/tokens` `/transactions` `/analysis` `/wallet` `/strategies/tpsl` `/settings`
Dev: `npm run dev` (:5173, proxies `/api` → :8081). `VITE_API_BASE` in `.env` only.

## Rules
`cn()` + `@theme` tokens; memo columns when price unit changes; localStorage try/catch.
New backend endpoint: note route + JSON — don't edit `backend/` unless asked.

## Tools
Grep first; read >150 lines with limit/offset; no Task/subagent for single lookups.
Done: `npm run build` here (not `cargo check` unless cross-stack). No commit/docs unless asked.
